<title>USA: IPO Kinetics postponed - underwriter.</title>
<headline>IPO Kinetics postponed - underwriter.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The planned initial public offering in Kinetics Group Inc was postponed due to market conditions, lead underwriter Smith Barney Inc said on Friday.</p>
<p>The initial public offering, tentatively scheduled to price on Thursday, was expected to offer 3.7 million shares at an estimated price range of $14 to $16.</p>
<p>The company provides high-purity process piping systems for the semiconductor, pharmaceutical and biotechnology industries.</p>
</text>
